                "entry_id": "19286d68-c926-3fa4-9acd-36256c061d56",
                "word": "megalography",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e3709d7a-efdd-3a86-a9b0-a2e957789a06",
                        "entry_id": "19286d68-c926-3fa4-9acd-36256c061d56",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The depiction of great or grand things, such as heroes and gods; painting on a large scale"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "96bd2238-f7f2-4f1d-8f56-acfe70015718",
                                "sense_id": "e3709d7a-efdd-3a86-a9b0-a2e957789a06",
                                "text": "The room was decorated with magnificent megalography, overwhelming the viewer upon entrance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89408e3d-0bfc-4863-9023-1d82ff0dc494",
                                "sense_id": "e3709d7a-efdd-3a86-a9b0-a2e957789a06",
                                "text": "What were, in short, these astonishing decorators of all sorts, lavishing frescoes, ceilings, and that historical megalography which surprises us even now by its boldness and breadth?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8088a27-94ce-4aa8-bad7-38a89bfd0372",
                                "sense_id": "e3709d7a-efdd-3a86-a9b0-a2e957789a06",
                                "text": "The Pompeian houses are usually small; the space which the architect gave over to the painter was not, as a rule, of great extent, and was little suited for what the Greeks styled \"megalography.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "192c383f-5dc3-3f58-a653-49c07aca285e",
                        "entry_id": "19286d68-c926-3fa4-9acd-36256c061d56",
                        "glosses": [
                            "macrography; form of dysgraphia defined by unusually large handwriting"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0e94b985-2f59-4824-80cc-99d7a939fae3",
